Z||000000||Fiero5||10-25-2001||02:29 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/horrorsign.gif">        <BR>It was a dark and stormy night....<P><BR>LVMY88 and I were on our way home from a Halloween party, when the fog started getting getting really thick. I flipped the high beams up on Fiero9, but I could hardly see 10 feet in front of the car. My speedo then started to act goofy, and that is when I noticed it!      <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/666.gif">      My odometer was acting really wierd.<P>We had to stop as the weather was nasty and I couldn't see to drive my Fiero anymore.<BR>That is when we noticed the house       <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/houselight.gif">       <P>I parked the Fiero off the side of the road, and decided to go see if we could use the phone at the house to tell the kids we were running late.<BR>Then LVMY88 and I heard a deep moan. We both turned around and yikes!       <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/druidwalk.gif">      <BR>We ran to the door of the house. The door was massive and looked like no door I had ever seen before.       <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/jailskel.gif">       <BR>The house had gargoyles, and LVMY88 was sure that she saw one of the statues move.       <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/gargoylewings.gif">       <BR>I told her she was just imagining things       <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/~discodor/gargblink.gif">     <P>[This message has been edited by Fiero5 (edited 10-25-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Fiero5 (edited 10-25-2001).]||||reg||11
